# b00t SCM Conventions datum
# .tomllmd — mdtable format for column-stable serialization
# schema: 1 | bump ONLY on column layout change, not on row addition
# last_updated: 2026-05-04
#
# 🤓 Schema for conventional commit types, branch naming patterns, and
#    security tier conventions. Used by SCM guard Rhai functions and
#    k0mmand3r SCM subcommands.
#
# 🔗参 _b00t_/hive-guards.hive.toml — SCM guard patterns (regex, rhai)
# 🔗参 b00t-cli/src/hook_engine.rs — Rhai engine with regex_match()
# 🔗参 k0mmand3r::scm_conventions!() — compile-time deserialization

[b00t]
name = "SCM-CONVENTIONS"
type = "schema"
hint = "SCM conventions — commit types, branch naming, security tiers; schema for SCM guard validation"

[b00t.version]
schema = 1
content = "stable"

## Conventional Commit Types
## schema_version=1: these 5 columns in this order.
## Columns: type | description | bump | scope_required | prerelease

| type | description | bump | scope_required | prerelease |
|------|-------------|------|----------------|-----------|
| feat | A new feature | minor | false | false |
| fix | A bug fix | patch | false | false |
| chore | Maintenance, tooling, deps | none | false | true |
| docs | Documentation only | none | false | false |
| refactor | Code change with no functional change | none | false | false |
| test | Adding or fixing tests | none | false | false |
| style | Formatting, whitespace, typos | none | false | false |
| ci | CI/CD pipeline changes | none | true | true |
| perf | Performance improvement | patch | false | false |
| revert | Reverting a previous change | none | true | false |
| security | Security fix or hardening | patch | true | false |
| experiment | Experimental — may be reverted | none | false | true |
| release | Release commit — bump version | custom | false | true |
| merge | Merge branch into branch | none | false | true |

## Branch Naming Conventions
## schema_version=1: these 4 columns in this order.
## Columns: pattern | description | allowed_on | protected

| pattern | description | allowed_on | protected |
|---------|-------------|------------|-----------|
| feat/* | New feature branches | feature branches | false |
| fix/* | Bug fix branches | feature branches | false |
| chore/* | Maintenance branches | feature branches | false |
| docs/* | Documentation branches | feature branches | false |
| refactor/* | Refactoring branches | feature branches | false |
| experiment/* | Experimental branches | feature branches | false |
| main | Production branch | always | true |
| dev | Development branch | always | true |
| release/* | Release branches | protected | true |
| pr-* | Auto-generated PR refs | CI-only | true |
| dependabot/* | Dep update branches | CI-only | true |

## Security Escalation Tiers
## schema_version=1: these 5 columns in this order.
## Columns: tier | guard_action | emoji | shortcode | effect

| tier | guard_action | emoji | shortcode | effect |
|------|-------------|-------|-----------|--------|
| 0 | pass | ✅ | :pass: | Allow — no intervention |
| 1 | warn+redirect | 🦨 | :skunk: | Warning + redirect command |
| 2 | block+escalate | 💩 | :poop: | Block command, escalate to operator |
| 3 | deny+firewall | 🚫 | :block: | Permanent denial, block at gateway |

## Commit Scope Convention
## schema_version=1: these 3 columns in this order.
## Columns: scope | description | example

| scope | description | example |
|-------|-------------|---------|
| (none) | General changes not scoped to a crate | `fix: correct typo in docs` |
| b00t-cli | CLI crate changes | `feat(b00t-cli): add guard violation command` |
| b00t-mcp | MCP server crate changes | `fix(b00t-mcp): handle empty tool list` |
| b00t-py | Python bindings changes | `feat(b00t-py): add mcp_list binding` |
| b00t-c0re-lib | Core library changes | `refactor(b00t-c0re-lib): deduplicate rhai engine` |
| l3dg3rr | Ledgerr vendor integration | `chore(l3dg3rr): update submodule to ledgrrr` |
| hive | Hive peer/CMDB changes | `feat(hive): wire gossip loop into init` |
| ci | CI/CD changes | `ci: fix release gate branch filter` |
| guards | Guard pipeline changes | `feat(guards): add SCM convention guards` |
| schema | Schema datum changes | `docs(schema): add SCM-CONVENTIONS schema` |

